  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T14:05:25.900700Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T14:18:35.592405Z",
  "totalBlocks": 15,
  "translatedBlocks": 15,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79d30fb575cc3676",
      "translationZh": "我一直在关注 <32B 的模型领域，并且总会回到一个有趣的问题上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94211f34aba99736",
      "translationZh": "几年前，Hummingbird+ 之类的项目让人觉得，廉价的定制加速器（基于 FPGA）可能会成为本地推理的未来。但如今看来，真正的瓶颈似乎仍然是内存容量，而不是单纯的 TOPS 算力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "131483a3a566cea4",
      "translationZh": "对于想以合理的量化精度（Q5/Q6，而不是 INT4）运行现代 20B-32B 模型的人来说，所有选择似乎都需要做出妥协：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4c369ae407726e1b",
      "translationZh": "消费级 GPU 的带宽很高，但 VRAM 容量有限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fc864e7419f9046a",
      "translationZh": "NPU 和 AI 加速器通常有很强的计算能力，但内存不足。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9bc19d26ef066801",
      "translationZh": "FPGA 方案很有吸引力，但仍然受带宽限制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6f2a4724efadd7df",
      "translationZh": "Strix Halo 系统（GMKtec EVO-X2、Framework Desktop 等）提供容量庞大的统一内存池，但价格昂贵。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b34bb547a27e69d5",
      "translationZh": "“理想中”的加速器大概会是这样：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56f26a6220632151",
      "translationZh": "……但我觉得那样的东西目前还并不存在。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0283a450b76dbb20",
      "translationZh": "想问问用过 Strix Halo 系统进行本地推理的人：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4223c3f54fee742a",
      "translationZh": "用它们运行目前的 20B-32B 模型，体验如何？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c69b9e8a617aee09",
      "translationZh": "你们会不会后悔当初没有改买一台基于 3090/4090 的二手机器？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd89bf0b0f807dde",
      "translationZh": "统一内存在实际使用中的优势，是否比基准测试所呈现的更大？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58ab4d657f273ea0",
      "translationZh": "很好奇同时拥有这两类系统的人怎么看。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de0687effd9a8e0c",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Robert__Sinclair 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "local inference",
      "briefZh": "本地推理",
      "explanationZh": "在本地设备上运行模型并生成结果，而不是调用远程服务。"
    },
    {
      "term": "TOPS",
      "briefZh": "每秒万亿次运算",
      "explanationZh": "衡量计算吞吐量的指标；文中强调算力高并不能解决内存容量不足的问题。"
    },
    {
      "term": "FPGA",
      "briefZh": "现场可编程门阵列",
      "explanationZh": "可按需求配置硬件逻辑的芯片，可用于构建定制推理加速器。"
    },
    {
      "term": "quants",
      "briefZh": "量化精度",
      "explanationZh": "这里指模型权重的量化精度或量化版本，文中倾向于 Q5/Q6 而非 INT4。"
    },
    {
      "term": "VRAM",
      "briefZh": "显存",
      "explanationZh": "GPU 使用的内存，其容量限制了能容纳的模型规模。"
    },
    {
      "term": "NPUs",
      "briefZh": "神经网络处理器",
      "explanationZh": "面向神经网络计算的专用处理器，计算能力与可用内存容量是不同的限制因素。"
    },
    {
      "term": "bandwidth-constrained",
      "briefZh": "受带宽限制",
      "explanationZh": "性能受到数据传输速率限制，而不只是受到计算能力限制。"
    },
    {
      "term": "unified memory pools",
      "briefZh": "统一内存池",
      "explanationZh": "由不同处理单元共享的内存资源，文中强调其可提供较大的内存容量。"
    },
    {
      "term": "20B-32B models",
      "briefZh": "模型参数规模",
      "explanationZh": "参数量在 200 亿到 320 亿之间的模型，B 表示十亿。"
    },
    {
      "term": "unified memory",
      "briefZh": "统一内存",
      "explanationZh": "由 CPU 和 GPU 等处理单元共享的内存，可减少数据复制，并让模型使用共享的内存容量。"
    },
    {
      "term": "benchmarks",
      "briefZh": "基准测试",
      "explanationZh": "通过标准化测试衡量系统性能，但结果不一定完全反映实际使用体验。"
    }
  ],
